===============================================================================
Components deliberately NOT bundled
===============================================================================

jQuery, Toastr and OverlayScrollbars were vendored in earlier revisions and have
been removed:

  jQuery             AdminLTE 4 dropped its dependency on it.
  Toastr             Last released 2017 and jQuery-dependent; notifications use
                     the Bootstrap 5 toast component instead.
  OverlayScrollbars  AdminLTE 4 scrolls the sidebar natively via
                     .sidebar-wrapper.

